# Gate 7 Part 18 — demo authentication boundary. This is intentionally NOT a
# secret: it is a documented demo session token, not production auth. See
# evidence/recovery-hardening/authentication.md for the honesty boundary.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) to run the recovery sandbox on
# the /demo page locally. Without it, ARM/APPROVE/DISARM fail closed —
# read-only pages (the receipt, the Cactus/Sepolia lanes) work regardless.
MARKED_DEMO_SESSION_TOKEN=marked-hackathon-demo

# Gate 10 / Gate 10L — optional. The Marked Agent (proposal/fulfillment/receipt
# explanation, candidate fulfillment plans) is fully read-only and never has execution
# authority regardless of whether this is set — see evidence/agent-hardening/. When
# unset, every agent surface renders an honest "Agent unavailable" state rather than
# fabricating a response. Set MARKED_AGENT_PROVIDER + the matching key to light it up
# live; no code change required. OpenRouter is used with a specific, currently-free
# model (see evidence/agent-hardening/live-model/README.md) — no paid model, no silent
# fallback to one.
# MARKED_AGENT_PROVIDER=openrouter
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=nex-agi/nex-n2.5-pro:free
#
# Alternative provider (also supported, not used for this submission's live proof):
# MARKED_AGENT_PROVIDER=anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# LLM_API_KEY=
